# CardPilot

- Rankings are deterministic arithmetic on saved wallet rules — not financial advice and not LLM judgment at purchase time.
- Copy: humble estimates (“by the rules in your wallet”), never absolute “best card” guarantees.
- Never invent rates or MCCs; surface uncertainties for AI/seed/lookup data; user reviews before save.
- Suggest only cards in the user’s wallet.
- Keep `lib/engine/` pure. Prefer schema + post-process fixes over trusting model output.
- GitHub: **lohith2507** only — never **lveepuri_costco**.
